1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,555
Euronews reports that Ukraine may use part of the EU's 90 billion euro loan to buy anti-ballistic missile systems.

2
00:00:08,505 --> 00:00:16,079
Officials say Kyiv is discussing options as Russian strikes continue to hit civilians and infrastructure.

3
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:24,667
The question is politically sensitive because some EU countries want the money to support European defence producers whenever possible.

